 75SE c  2007ScZX, 2008Sc03: E=23 MeV beam provided by Yale tandem accelerator. 
 75SE2c  Enriched target. Particles detected with Enge spectrograph and         
 75SE3c  gas-filled focal plane detector backed by a scintillator. Measured     
 75SE4c  cross sections. FWHM=40 keV. Spectroscopic factors deduced from        
 75SE5c  analysis of cross section data by DWBA calculations using PTOLEMY code.
 75SE6c  Uncertainty in cross sections: statistical uncertainty of 1%           
 75SE7c  for strong peaks; systematic uncertainties of 5% in absolute values    
 75SE8c  and 3% in relative values.                                             
